{"meta":{"id":"ubuntu-install","category":"it/server/infra/home-server","title":"1. Ubuntu Server 설치","subtitle":"","summary":"Rufus DD 모드 USB, BIOS UEFI(Legacy 에선 M.2 부팅 실패), 설치 화면별 선택, 루트 볼륨 100 GB → 최대, 트러블슈팅","tags":["ubuntu","리눅스","서버","홈서버","설치","uefi"],"color":"indigo","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-indigo","source":"ubunto_start","updatedAt":"2026-10-31"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-indigo-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-indigo-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 border border-indigo-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></span>INSTALL</span>\r\n<span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wide text-stone-400 font-serif\">2026-10-31</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">1. Ubuntu Server 설치</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-indigo-50/70 border border-indigo-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-indigo-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> Rufus DD 모드 USB, BIOS UEFI(Legacy 에선 M.2 부팅 실패), 설치 화면별 선택, 루트 볼륨 100 GB → 최대, 트러블슈팅</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">설치 USB (Rufus)</h2></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">• Rufus 에서 USB 와 <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>ubuntu-26.04.1-live-server-amd64.iso</code> 선택<br>• 'ISOHybrid 이미지가 감지되었습니다' 창에서 <strong class='text-stone-900'>DD 이미지 모드</strong> 선택 — ISO 모드로 구웠을 때 UEFI 부팅이 안 됐다. DD 모드는 ISO 를 그대로 복사해 UEFI / Legacy 둘 다 부팅된다<br>• 다 구운 뒤 윈도우가 포맷하겠냐고 물으면 취소 (정상)</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">BIOS (F10)</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">설정</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">값</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">Boot Mode</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><strong class='text-stone-900'>UEFI Native (Without CSM)</strong></td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">SecureBoot</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><strong class='text-stone-900'>해제</strong></td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">부팅 메뉴</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">F9 → UEFI Boot Sources 에서 USB 선택</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">처음엔 Legacy 모드로 설치했다가 재부팅 후 <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>Boot Device Not Found</code> 가 났습니다. Boot Order 1순위가 M.2 SSD 였는데도 실패해서, 이 노트북은 Legacy 에서 M.2 부팅이 안 된다고 보고 UEFI 로 다시 설치했습니다.</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">설치 화면별 선택</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">화면</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">선택</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">Network</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">유선 랜에 DHCP 로 IP 할당 확인 → Done (와이파이 패키지도 같이 설치됨)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">Proxy · Mirror</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">비워 둠 / <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>kr.archive.ubuntu.com</code> 테스트 통과 확인</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">Guided storage</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">Use an entire disk → <strong class='text-stone-900'>SSD</strong> 선택 (HDD 아님), LVM 체크, LUKS 암호화는 <strong class='text-stone-900'>끔</strong> — 켜면 재부팅마다 노트북 앞에서 암호 입력</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">Storage configuration</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">기본값은 <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>/</code> 에 100 GB 만 할당 → <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>ubuntu-lv</code> Edit 로 최대 크기로 늘림</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">Profile</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">이름, 서버 이름 <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>homeserver</code>, 사용자, 비밀번호</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">Ubuntu Pro</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">Skip</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">SSH</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\"><strong class='text-stone-900'>Install OpenSSH server</strong> 체크</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">Featured snaps</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">아무것도 고르지 않고 Tab 으로 Done 이동 — 필요한 건 나중에 apt / snap 으로</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">디스크 최종 구성</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">마운트</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">크기</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">위치</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>/</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">235.4 G</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">SSD (LVM)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>/boot</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">2 G</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">SSD</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>/boot/efi</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">1.05 G (fat32)</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">SSD — <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>primary ESP</code> 로 나와야 UEFI 설치</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">HDD 는 설치 중엔 건드리지 않고 나중에 <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>/data</code> 로 따로 씁니다. SSD + HDD 를 LVM 하나로 묶을 수도 있지만 하나만 고장 나도 전체가 날아가고 SSD 속도 이점도 사라져서 분리했습니다. 루트 볼륨 늘리기를 놓쳤다면 설치 후에도 가능합니다.</p><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">bash</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">sudo lvextend -l +100%FREE /dev/ubuntu-vg/ubuntu-lv\r\nsudo resize2fs /dev/ubuntu-vg/ubuntu-lv</pre></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">첫 부팅</h2></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">• Reboot Now → 'remove the installation medium' 이 나오면 USB 뽑고 Enter<br>• cloud-init 이 SSH 호스트 키(RSA / ECDSA / ED25519)를 만드는 로그가 지나감 — 멈추면 Enter 로 <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>homeserver login:</code> 프롬프트</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">트러블슈팅</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">증상</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">원인</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">해결</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">Featured snaps 화면에서 멈춤</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">Done 버튼이 안 보이거나 네트워크 문제</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">Tab 으로 Done 이동, 안 되면 랜선 빼고 오프라인 설치</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>Boot Device Not Found (3F0)</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">Legacy 모드에서 M.2 SSD 부팅 불가</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">BIOS 를 UEFI Native 로 바꾸고 재설치</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">배터리 경고 후 검은 화면</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">UEFI 로 부팅할 장치가 없음</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">F9 로 USB 선택, 안 되면 Rufus <strong class='text-stone-900'>DD 모드</strong>로 다시 굽기</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">GRUB 뒤 검은 화면</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">그래픽 드라이버</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">GRUB 에서 <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>e</code> → linux 줄 <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>---</code> 앞에 <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>nomodeset</code> → Ctrl+X</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-indigo-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">HP BATTERY ALERT (601)</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">배터리 수명 경고일 뿐</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">Enter 로 넘어감. 대신 충전기는 항상 연결</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n","path":"it/server/infra/home-server/ubuntu-install","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"server","title":"서버","path":"it/server"},{"id":"infra","title":"인프라","path":"it/server/infra"},{"id":"home-server","title":"홈 서버 (Ubuntu)","path":"it/server/infra/home-server"}],"hasImage":false}